<title>USA: Zenith Electronics Corp Q4 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Zenith Electronics Corp Q4 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>GLENVIEW, Ill. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In millions, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>				   Q4 Ended	     Year Ended</p>
<p>			    Dec. 31,   Dec. 31,  Dec. 31,   Dec. 31,</p>
<p>				 1996	 1995	1996	1995</p>
<p> Net sales		  $427.6    $394.7  $1,287.9   $1,273.9</p>
<p> Cost of products sold   437.6     368.3   1,257.0    1,188.8</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>   administrative	   44.3	40.9     167.8	128.8</p>
<p> Engineering and research 12.1	 9.3	46.7	 43.5</p>
<p>Other operating expense</p>
<p>   (income), net	    (9.6)    (10.5)    (26.3)     (30.1)</p>
<p> Restructuring charges     9.3	 3.6	 9.3	 21.6</p>
<p> Operating income (loss) (66.1)    (16.9)   (166.6)     (78.7)</p>
<p> Gain (loss) on asset sales --	(2.5)	0.3	 (1.7)</p>
<p> Income taxes (credit)    (0.1)	  --	0.2	 (7.7)</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	 (69.3)    (23.0)   (178.0)     (90.8)</p>
<p>Net income (loss) per</p>
<p>  common share	     (1.05)    (0.42)    (2.73)     (1.85)</p>
<p> Weighted average shares  66.4	55.2	65.2	 49.2</p>
<p>NOTE: Company said current Q4 includes about $40 million in unsual charges and reflects higher operating costs.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
